omen on the Labour benches who she  said now moan that this all got out of  hand but they were screaming a vile  abuse at the Prime Minister through that  period if I had been speaker I would I'm  not going to be speaker by the way nor  do I want to be but if I had been I  would have cut that process short three  and a half hours was too long because  far too many people got wound up and he  should have cut it short I think and  said enough enough

